    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\r\n\r\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\r\n\r\n### Module(s)\r\n\r\nmini.ai\r\n\r\n### Question\r\n\r\nI was editing a TSX file so I wanted to use the incredible mini.ai text objects but when I tired selecting html tags and custom components it couldn't handle it. then I used :InspectTree from treesitter and I saw a pretty good tag integration but I want to keep using mini.ai and having the good tag integration like one in the treesitter.\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n        <div className=\"flex flex-col gap-4 lg:col-span-2 col-span-2 my-15 lg:ml-2 mx-auto\">\r\n          <motion.h1\r\n            initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 10 }} animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\r\n            className=\"text-5xl whitespace-nowrap font-bold\"\r\n          >\r\n            some some <br /> someting\r\n          </motion.h1>\r\n\r\n          <motion.h4\r\n            initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 10 }} transition={{ delay: 0.2 }} animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\r\n            className=\"text-lg/6 mx-2 font-normal text-foreground/80\">\r\n            somethign text to write<br /> text          </motion.h4>\r\n\r\n          <motion.div\r\n            initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 10, scale: 0.6 }}\r\n            animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0, scale: 1 }}\r\n            transition={{ delay: 0.3 }}\r\n            className=\"tracking-wide mt-6\">\r\n            <Button asChild className=\"w-full text-lg font-semibold\">\r\n              <Link href=\"/authentication/register\">\r\n                someting\r\n              </Link>\r\n            </Button>\r\n          </motion.div>\r\n        </div>\r\n```\r\n\r\nwhen I want to select the <motion.h1> tag it selects the outter div insted of the <motion.h1> and it is realy frustrating for me so if anyone can help I will be very tankfull.",
    "bodyHTML": "<h3 dir=\"auto\">Contributing guidelines</h3>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> I have read <a href=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md\">CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Module(s)</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">mini.ai</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Question</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I was editing a TSX file so I wanted to use the incredible mini.ai text objects but when I tired selecting html tags and custom components it couldn't handle it. then I used :InspectTree from treesitter and I saw a pretty good tag integration but I want to keep using mini.ai and having the good tag integration like one in the treesitter.</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"\n        &lt;div className=&quot;flex flex-col gap-4 lg:col-span-2 col-span-2 my-15 lg:ml-2 mx-auto&quot;&gt;\n          &lt;motion.h1\n            initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 10 }} animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\n            className=&quot;text-5xl whitespace-nowrap font-bold&quot;\n          &gt;\n            some some &lt;br /&gt; someting\n          &lt;/motion.h1&gt;\n\n          &lt;motion.h4\n            initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 10 }} transition={{ delay: 0.2 }} animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\n            className=&quot;text-lg/6 mx-2 font-normal text-foreground/80&quot;&gt;\n            somethign text to write&lt;br /&gt; text          &lt;/motion.h4&gt;\n\n          &lt;motion.div\n            initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 10, scale: 0.6 }}\n            animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0, scale: 1 }}\n            transition={{ delay: 0.3 }}\n            className=&quot;tracking-wide mt-6&quot;&gt;\n            &lt;Button asChild className=&quot;w-full text-lg font-semibold&quot;&gt;\n              &lt;Link href=&quot;/authentication/register&quot;&gt;\n                someting\n              &lt;/Link&gt;\n            &lt;/Button&gt;\n          &lt;/motion.div&gt;\n        &lt;/div&gt;\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">\n        &lt;div className=\"flex flex-col gap-4 lg:col-span-2 col-span-2 my-15 lg:ml-2 mx-auto\"&gt;\n          &lt;motion.h1\n            initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 10 }} animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\n            className=\"text-5xl whitespace-nowrap font-bold\"\n          &gt;\n            some some &lt;br /&gt; someting\n          &lt;/motion.h1&gt;\n\n          &lt;motion.h4\n            initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 10 }} transition={{ delay: 0.2 }} animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\n            className=\"text-lg/6 mx-2 font-normal text-foreground/80\"&gt;\n            somethign text to write&lt;br /&gt; text          &lt;/motion.h4&gt;\n\n          &lt;motion.div\n            initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 10, scale: 0.6 }}\n            animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0, scale: 1 }}\n            transition={{ delay: 0.3 }}\n            className=\"tracking-wide mt-6\"&gt;\n            &lt;Button asChild className=\"w-full text-lg font-semibold\"&gt;\n              &lt;Link href=\"/authentication/register\"&gt;\n                someting\n              &lt;/Link&gt;\n            &lt;/Button&gt;\n          &lt;/motion.div&gt;\n        &lt;/div&gt;\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">when I want to select the &lt;motion.h1&gt; tag it selects the outter div insted of the &lt;motion.h1&gt; and it is realy frustrating for me so if anyone can help I will be very tankfull.</p>",
    "bodyText": "Contributing guidelines\n\n I have read CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md\n\nModule(s)\nmini.ai\nQuestion\nI was editing a TSX file so I wanted to use the incredible mini.ai text objects but when I tired selecting html tags and custom components it couldn't handle it. then I used :InspectTree from treesitter and I saw a pretty good tag integration but I want to keep using mini.ai and having the good tag integration like one in the treesitter.\n\n        <div className=\"flex flex-col gap-4 lg:col-span-2 col-span-2 my-15 lg:ml-2 mx-auto\">\n          <motion.h1\n            initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 10 }} animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\n            className=\"text-5xl whitespace-nowrap font-bold\"\n          >\n            some some <br /> someting\n          </motion.h1>\n\n          <motion.h4\n            initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 10 }} transition={{ delay: 0.2 }} animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\n            className=\"text-lg/6 mx-2 font-normal text-foreground/80\">\n            somethign text to write<br /> text          </motion.h4>\n\n          <motion.div\n            initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 10, scale: 0.6 }}\n            animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0, scale: 1 }}\n            transition={{ delay: 0.3 }}\n            className=\"tracking-wide mt-6\">\n            <Button asChild className=\"w-full text-lg font-semibold\">\n              <Link href=\"/authentication/register\">\n                someting\n              </Link>\n            </Button>\n          </motion.div>\n        </div>\n\nwhen I want to select the <motion.h1> tag it selects the outter div insted of the <motion.h1> and it is realy frustrating for me so if anyone can help I will be very tankfull.",
